{"id":"vets-db","label":"Vets database","short":"vets, specialties","layer":"data","repo":"spring-petclinic-microservices",
 "purpose":"Relational store for vets, specialties and the link table between them. By default an embedded HSQLDB initialised from schema.sql and data.sql; a MySQL profile exists in the shared config.",
 "callout":"docker-compose.yml starts no database container for vets-service.",
 "stores":["tables: vets, specialties, vet_specialties"],
 "evidence":[
